<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Wavelength Migration Services | Healthcare registration and migration</title>
<meta name="description" content="Wavelength Migration Services is the specialist regulatory and migration partner for Australia and New Zealand's health sector, for employers and international health professionals.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/assets/img/favicon.png">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/img/mark.svg">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/assets/img/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,400;1,800&display=swap">

{% include "styles.njk" %}

</head>
<body>
{% include "header.njk" %}

<main id="top">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-glow"></div>
    <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true">
      <img class="hero-mark" src="/assets/img/mark.svg" alt="">
      <svg class="hero-diag" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMaxYMax slice" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round">
        <path d="M300 420 L 620 100" stroke="#E87722" stroke-width="2.5" opacity=".22"/>
        <path d="M360 420 L 680 100" stroke="#0C7A82" stroke-width="2" opacity=".16"/>
        <path d="M240 420 L 560 100" stroke="#62BBB0" stroke-width="2" opacity=".28"/>
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow eyebrow">Wavelength Migration Services</p>
      <h1>Healthcare talent across borders, <span class="accent">without the regulatory friction</span></h1>
      <p class="sub">Wavelength Migration Services is the specialist regulatory and migration partner for Australia and New Zealand&rsquo;s health sector — guiding employers through large-scale recruitment projects and helping individual practitioners secure their registration and visa with certainty.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a href="#employers" class="btn btn-primary">I&rsquo;m a health employer <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        <a href="#professionals" class="btn btn-ghost">I&rsquo;m a health professional</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta">
        <div class="item"><div class="n">100%</div><div class="l">compliance with regulatory &amp; migration requirements</div></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="n">110+</div><div class="l">nomination applications delivered on a single project</div></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="n">MARA</div><div class="l">registered migration agents on the team</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AUDIENCE SPLIT -->
  <div class="split">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a href="#employers" class="aud-card reveal">
        <div class="aud-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 21h18M6 21V7l6-4 6 4v14"/><path d="M10 9h.01M14 9h.01M10 13h.01M14 13h.01M10 17h.01M14 17h.01"/></svg></div>
        <div class="tag">For health employers</div>
        <h3>Bring a workforce in, compliantly and at scale</h3>
        <p>Sponsorship, AHPRA and college registration, Area of Need and DWS advice, Medicare numbers and visa nominations — managed end-to-end across your whole cohort.</p>
        <span class="go">Explore employer services <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
      </a>
      <a href="#professionals" class="aud-card reveal">
        <div class="aud-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 12a4 4 0 1 0 0-8 4 4 0 0 0 0 8Z"/><path d="M5 21a7 7 0 0 1 14 0"/></svg></div>
        <div class="tag">For health professionals</div>
        <h3>Get registered, get your visa, get to work</h3>
        <p>From AHPRA or MCNZ registration and Primary Source Verification to your visa and your family&rsquo;s — a dedicated consultant handles the paperwork while you focus on the move.</p>
        <span class="go">Explore support for practitioners <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EMPLOYERS -->
  <section id="employers">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="service">
        <div class="s-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">For health employers</p>
          <h2>One partner for the whole regulatory and migration burden</h2>
          <p class="lead">Whether you&rsquo;re nominating a single overseas specialist or standing up a cohort of dozens, Wavelength Migration Services removes the administrative risk from international recruitment — so roles are filled faster, and every appointment is fully compliant from day one.</p>
          <div class="chips">
            <span class="chip">Mass recruitment projects</span>
            <span class="chip">Sponsorship &amp; nomination</span>
            <span class="chip">Regulatory compliance</span>
            <span class="chip">Australia &amp; New Zealand</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="s-panel">
          <ul class="svc-list">
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>AHPRA registration &amp; medical college applications</b> — managed across your whole intake, with the college pathway matched to each practitioner.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Area of Need &amp; District of Workforce Shortage advice</b> — DWS and DPA positioning so you can employ doctors you might not otherwise reach.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Primary Source Verification</b> — AMC and EPIC assistance, plus MCNZ vocational, provisional general and locum tenens applications.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Medicare provider &amp; prescriber numbers</b> — including 19AB, academic and other exemptions.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Immigration &amp; visa nomination</b> — temporary skilled shortage programs, employer nomination scheme applications and permanent pathways.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service rev" style="margin-top:64px">
        <div class="s-copy">
          <div class="stat-card">
            <div class="big">110<span class="plus">+</span></div>
            <div class="cap">employer nomination applications delivered for a single regional healthcare provider recruiting internationally.</div>
            <div class="rule"></div>
            <div class="foot">Proof that we scale — from one appointment to an entire workforce program.</div>
            <img class="cardmark" src="/assets/img/mark.svg" alt="">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="s-copy">
          <h2>Why employers hand this to us</h2>
          <ul class="svc-list">
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>100% compliance.</b> Every regulatory and migration requirement met — no gaps, no surprises at audit.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Minimised processing time.</b> We keep applications moving and keep you informed at every stage.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>One step ahead.</b> We know the common complications before they arise and design around them.</span></li>
            <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Wider talent pool.</b> We find pathways to appoint practitioners you may not otherwise be able to employ.</span></li>
          </ul>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:26px">Discuss a project <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PROFESSIONALS -->
  <section id="professionals" class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="service">
        <div class="s-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow">For health professionals</p>
          <h2>Your move to Australia or New Zealand, expertly handled</h2>
          <p class="lead">Registration and migration are where an international career stalls. We give you a dedicated consultant and a registered migration agent to manage the detail — so your paperwork is right the first time and your start date holds.</p>
          <div class="chips">
            <span class="chip">AHPRA &amp; MCNZ registration</span>
            <span class="chip">Visas for you &amp; family</span>
            <span class="chip">Specialist pathways</span>
            <span class="chip">Medicare numbers</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top:26px">Start your enquiry <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="s-panel">
          <div class="panel-note">
            <ul class="svc-list">
              <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Registration.</b> AHPRA registration and medical college applications, with DPA advice for GPs and DWS advice for specialists.</span></li>
              <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Verification.</b> Primary Source Verification through AMC and EPIC, and MCNZ vocational, provisional general and locum tenens applications.</span></li>
              <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Medicare.</b> Provider and prescriber numbers, including 19AB and academic exemptions.</span></li>
              <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Migration.</b> Temporary skilled shortage and employer nomination visas, plus permanent options — handled by MARA-registered agents.</span></li>
              <li><span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg></span><span><b>Your family.</b> Support with family member migration so the whole household arrives together.</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- APPROACH -->
  <section id="approach">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">The pathway</p>
        <h2>A clear route from offer to first day</h2>
        <p>Once a role is secured, our team swings into action — mapping the regulatory and migration requirements specific to your specialty and driving each one to completion.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">1</div><h4>Assessment</h4><p>We review the practitioner&rsquo;s profile and the role to map the exact registration, Medicare and visa requirements.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">2</div><h4>Registration</h4><p>AHPRA or MCNZ registration, Primary Source Verification and the right medical college pathway.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">3</div><h4>Migration</h4><p>Visa nomination and application for the practitioner and family, managed by a registered migration agent.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">4</div><h4>Medicare &amp; approvals</h4><p>Provider and prescriber numbers, exemptions, Area of Need and DWS approvals put in place.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal"><div class="num">5</div><h4>Arrival</h4><p>Cleared to start on time, fully compliant — with the team on hand through the transition.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- WHY -->
  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Why Wavelength Migration</p>
        <h2>Specialist knowledge that de-risks the crossing</h2>
        <p>Regulatory and migration work rewards experience and current knowledge. That is all we do.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></div><h4>Full compliance, assured</h4><p>Every administrative requirement met to standard, so appointments hold up to scrutiny.</p></div>
        <div class="why reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 8v4l3 2"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/></svg></div><h4>Faster processing</h4><p>We keep every application moving and flag issues before they cost you time.</p></div>
        <div class="why reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20V10M12 20V4M20 20v-7"/></svg></div><h4>MARA-registered agents</h4><p>Migration handled by agents bound by the MARA Code of Conduct, with contacts across the regulators.</p></div>
        <div class="why reveal"><div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></div><h4>Responsive by design</h4><p>A named consultant per case and a commitment to respond within 48 hours of your enquiry.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ABOUT -->
  <section id="about">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
        <h2>Built inside a leading medical recruiter, focused on one thing</h2>
        <p>Wavelength Migration Services brings the regulatory and migration expertise developed inside Wavelength Group into a dedicated, specialist practice — getting qualified health professionals registered, sponsored and cleared to practise in Australia and New Zealand, reliably and at any scale.</p>
        <div class="endorse"><img src="/assets/img/mark.svg" alt=""> Part of Wavelength Group</div>
      </div>
      <div class="team">
{%- for p in team.members %}
        <article class="person reveal">
          <img class="pphoto" src="{{ p.photo }}" alt="{{ p.name }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
          <div class="pinfo">
            <div class="name">{{ p.name }}</div>
            <div class="role">{{ p.role }}</div>
            {%- for para in p.bio.split("

") %}
            <p class="bio">{{ para }}</p>
            {%- endfor %}
            <div class="cx">
              {%- if p.email %}
              <a href="mailto:{{ p.email }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m2 7 10 6 10-6"/></svg> {{ p.email }}</a>
              {%- endif %}
              {%- if p.phone %}
              <a href="tel:{{ p.phone | noSpace }}"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.4-1.2a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z"/></svg> {{ p.phone }}</a>
              {%- endif %}
              {%- if p.linkedin %}
              <a href="{{ p.linkedin }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.56v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.35V9h3.42v1.56h.05c.48-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28ZM5.34 7.43a2.07 2.07 0 1 1 0-4.14 2.07 2.07 0 0 1 0 4.14ZM7.12 20.45H3.55V9h3.57v11.45ZM22.22 0H1.77C.8 0 0 .78 0 1.75v20.5C0 23.22.8 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.78 1.78-1.75V1.75C24 .78 23.2 0 22.22 0Z"/></svg> LinkedIn</a>
              {%- endif %}
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
{%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
  <section id="testimonials" class="band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Testimonials</p>
        <h2>Doctors and employers, in their own words</h2>
        <p>Recent five-star reviews from the practitioners and organisations our team has guided through registration, migration and visas.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tst-grid">
{%- for t in testimonials.items %}
        <figure class="tst"><div class="date">{{ t.date }}</div><div class="stars" aria-label="5 out of 5 stars">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“{{ t.quote }}”</blockquote><figcaption class="by"><span class="who">{{ t.name }}</span>{% if t.consultant %}<span class="for">for {{ t.consultant }}</span>{% endif %}</figcaption></figure>
{%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section id="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="contact">
        <img class="cardmark" src="/assets/img/mark.svg" alt="">
        <div class="inner">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow hero-eyebrow" style="color:var(--pink)">Make an enquiry</p>
            <h2>Let&rsquo;s talk about your project or your move</h2>
            <p>Tell us what you need — a workforce program to staff, or a single registration and visa to secure. A member of our team will get back to you within 48 hours to discuss the next steps.</p>
            <div class="cta-row">
              <a href="mailto:efaulkner@wave.com.au?subject=Wavelength%20Migration%20Services%20enquiry" class="btn btn-on-dark">Email the team <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></a>
              <a href="tel:+61283539079" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Call us</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-details">
            <div class="row">
              <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m2 7 10 6 10-6"/></svg></div>
              <div><div class="k">Email</div><div class="v"><a href="mailto:efaulkner@wave.com.au">efaulkner@wave.com.au</a></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8.1 9.9a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.4-1.2a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.5c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2Z"/></svg></div>
              <div><div class="k">Phone</div><div class="v"><a href="tel:+61283539079">+61 2 8353 9079</a></div></div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10Z"/></svg></div>
              <div><div class="k">Practice</div><div class="v">Wavelength Migration Services</div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

{% include "footer.njk" %}

{% include "scripts.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
